// Body holsters for the Aliens set (zscript/rsq/holster.zs,
// tool/hands/ae_holster_gen.py). Do not edit by hand.
//
// Each block shows the gun's OWN pickup model, which lives in the base
// addon: MODELDEF resolves Path across every loaded archive, so these
// reference the existing meshes instead of duplicating them.
//
// One block per holster because Scale and Path are per block and every
// pickup has its own.
//
// 2026-10-22: these Scales are the pickup blocks' numbers, which the TC writes
// against weapon actors scaled 0.15 (satchel 0.1). The ghost ACTORS now carry
// that scale (zscript/rsq/holstertable.zs), which is what makes these blocks
// come out pickup-sized instead of ten times too big. The knife block is the
// HUD mesh at its HUD scale; its ghost carries the HUD->world factor 0.3468.

Model AE_Holster_Pistol
{
	Path "models/weapons/pistol"
	Model 0 "m4a3_pickup.md3"
	Skin 0 "m4a3.png"
	Scale 3.50 3.50 3.50
	FrameIndex HLPI A 0 0
}

Model AE_Holster_Knife
{
	Path "models/weapons/knife"
	Model 0 "knife.md3"
	Skin 0 "knife.png"
	Scale 0.65 0.65 0.65
	FrameIndex HLKN A 0 0
}

